        <p>TRH MAMMOTH HOUSE FURNISHERS. "TI/n NTHEON," GAYTHORN, MANCHESTER. AMPORIUM OF THE WORLD FOR HIGH-CLAS SECOND-HAND FURNITURE.</p>
